# Build artifacts. The deck and the three scripts are the source; everything a run
# produces is derived and belongs nowhere near the repository.
#
# The finished mp4 and .vtt DO get committed - but to frontend/public/site-v2/, which is
# what nginx bakes into its image. A second copy here would be a second thing to keep in
# sync, and the one under site-v2 is the one that ships.
audio/
segments/
check/
*-bg.png
bg.png
*-concat.txt
concat.txt
*-walkthrough.mp4
*-walkthrough.vtt
